121	    // path); sendMagicLinkEmail stands in for a completely unrelated US shopper's
122	    // password-reset request, in flight on the same process at the same time.
123	    // Nothing in the code scopes the failure to the customer or region that
124	    // triggered it — only which Node process happened to be handling both.
